      "reason": "Not a word cluster: found by reading the sweep. Rocco (\"The Official GTA 6 Dog\", $1.65M), EEGL (\"Actual GTA VI Character\", $0.85M) and RETIRE (\"GTA6 runner\", $0.47M) are three Pump.fun coins whose metadata names GTA 6, $2.96M combined 24h volume, with Rockstar Games' own post of 2026-11-05 (two weeks to the 2026-11-19 launch, new screenshots) and iGrandTheftAuto.com's post that the dog is named Rocco (e3:0, e3:1). Created at the six-narrative cap by pausing the Anakin Skywalker coins ($0.37M)."
